CUBES
MAYER--VIETORIS 6b source / 6c target : full sieves, union and intersection PASS
MAYER--VIETORIS 6b target : full sieves, union and intersection PASS
MAYER--VIETORIS 6c source : full sieves, union and intersection PASS
FUNCTOR 6b f0 = object map {'a': 'o', 'b': 'o'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6b f1 = object map {'a': 'o', 'b': 'o', 'v': 'v'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6b f2 = object map {'a': 'o', 'b': 'o', 'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6b f3 = object map {'a': 'o', 'b': 'o', 'v': 'v', 'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6c f0 = object map {'a': 'a', 'b': 'b'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6c f1 = object map {'a': 'a', 'b': 'b'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6c f2 = object map {'a': 'a', 'b': 'b', 'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR 6c f3 = object map {'a': 'a', 'b': 'b', 'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
Every square of each cube commutes: the displayed object maps agree on overlaps.
Sigma(A) has four edges and four vertices, hence is the explicit circle K_2,2.
The BZ functor labels a->v by 1 and the other three edges by 0; cycle degree = 1.
MAYER--VIETORIS thin W1 6b source : full sieves, union and intersection PASS
FUNCTOR thin W1 6b f0 = object map {} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR thin W1 6b f1 = object map {'v': 'v'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR thin W1 6b f2 = object map {'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR thin W1 6b f3 = object map {'v': 'v', 'w': 'w'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
thin Wlc 6b pi0-bijection flags: f0=False, f1=True, f2=True, f3=True
thin Wlc 6c pi0-bijection flags: f0=True, f1=False, f2=True, f3=True
thin W1 6b pi0-surjection flags: f0=False, f1=True, f2=True, f3=True
FUNCTOR thin W1 7b section = object map {'o': 'a', 'v': 'v'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
FUNCTOR thin W1 7b fibre = object map {'o': 'a'} ; arrows induced uniquely; PASS
thin W1 7b: section is a weak equivalence of contractible categories; fibre misses one of two components.
ALL FINITE CATEGORY AND NERVE CHECKS PASSED
